# The eleventh round of apps: what each leans on.
# Authenticator: reading QR codes from a screenshot or picture
zbar-tools
# Messages: Matrix, with end-to-end encryption
python3-matrix-nio
python3-olm
# Screen Sharing: FreeRDP's viewer (seeing another computer's screen); sharing this one is the compositor's own
freerdp-sdl
# Privacy Report: who has the camera, microphone and screen (pw-dump), who went online (ss), location in use (busctl)
pipewire-bin
iproute2
systemd
# Fonts: listing and installing (fc-list, fc-query, fc-cache)
fontconfig
# Characters: Unicode's own emoji list; a bundled copy is used when it's missing
unicode-data
